    "created_at": "2026-08-20T21:03:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-20T21:03:55Z",
    "body": "Chrome seems to have the ability to access frames by name until the name is changed, then I find no agreement between any two browser engines.  WebKit's site isolation prototype currently broadcasts frame name changes to all processes, but if we agree to not do that I imagine we could change that.  It would be good to agree if we can.",
